WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:94% size:96% align:center
First, download the Troia ZIP and extract it.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000 line:94% size:96% align:center
Enable Developer mode. Click Load unpacked.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000 line:94% size:96% align:center
Select the troia-testnet folder, then click Select.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000 line:94% size:96% align:center
Troia now appears in your extensions. Keep it enabled.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000 line:94% size:96% align:center
Open Troia from the extensions menu. You are ready.
